<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><a href="/jbhl">HOME</a> / HOME LOAN OPTIONS</p><h1>Take the next step toward a place of your own.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Understand your borrowing options and what happens from your first conversation through to settlement.</p><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Discuss a purchase <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="page-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Australian home in a landscaped garden"></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT TO CONSIDER</p><h2>Buy a home: start with your situation.</h2><p>There is no single loan structure that suits everyone. We will talk through what you want to achieve, how a loan could fit your budget and what you should understand before applying.</p></div><div class="detail-rows"><div class="detail-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Work out your starting point</h3><p>We discuss your deposit, income, existing commitments and what repayments could comfortably fit your budget.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Explore suitable loans</h3><p>Compare the structure and features of available home loans against your plans, rather than focusing on one headline rate.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Move through the process</h3><p>We explain documentation, assessment, approval and settlement so you know what to expect at each stage.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-section section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>A few things worth knowing.</h2></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Do I need to find a property before I speak with you?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. An early conversation can help you understand your options before you start making offers.</p></details><details><summary>Is borrowing power the same as an affordable budget?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. A lending assessment and your day-to-day comfort with repayments are different considerations.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
